### First page of patients through the API gateway (default size 20, sorted by name)
# Staff only (ADMIN, DOCTOR, NURSE, BILLING_STAFF); a PATIENT token gets a 403.
# {{accessToken}} comes from logging in via api-requests/gateway/.
# Response shape: {"content": [...], "page": {"size", "number", "totalElements", "totalPages"}}
GET http://localhost:4004/api/v1/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Second page of 5 patients, most recently registered first
# Sortable properties: name, email, dateOfBirth, registeredDate. Sizes above 100 are capped.
GET http://localhost:4004/api/v1/patients?page=1&size=5&sort=registeredDate,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
